# Architecture Decision Records

## ADR-0001: SpatialEngine owns desktop presentation state

Status: Accepted, clarified.

SpatialEngine owns desktop bounds, state, focus and z-index. WindowRegistry owns
Android task identity. SpatialEngine is therefore the presentation source of truth,
not the complete native lifecycle source of truth.

## ADR-0002: Unify native lifecycle through task identity

Status: Proposed.

Use native task ID as authoritative identity after promotion and maintain an explicit
mapping during synthetic launch. Package names are metadata, not unique identity.
All bounds operations share one path; close and external removal clean up both models.
